0 -13 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Eye Aspect Ratio \(EAR\), blink events and rolling blink rate.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 10 Tf
(- Mouth Aspect Ratio \(MAR\) and jaw opening.) Tj
0 -13 Td
/F1 10 Tf
